  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient harbor or bay, now largely in-filled, that extended eastward inland from modern Turkey's Gulf of Ku\u015fadas\u0131. The area of the ancient feature, as reconstructed in BAtlas map 61, is partially coincident today with the western half of the Izmir Sel\u00e7uk Gebekirse Lake Wildlife Development Area.",
